WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:03.480
Blegh!

00:03.990 --> 00:05.610
She's gone?

00:07.090 --> 00:08.680
Good grief...

00:08.680 --> 00:11.490
What a hopeless shut-in princess.

00:12.020 --> 00:13.290
As you can see,

00:13.290 --> 00:15.700
this is what our nation's princess is like.

00:16.400 --> 00:19.410
I think it'll prove difficult 
to get the ring from her.

00:19.410 --> 00:22.250
Uh, who might you be?

00:22.680 --> 00:24.670
I'm Jade Romca.

00:24.670 --> 00:27.880
I'm the eldest son 
of the previous Wind King Romca,

00:27.880 --> 00:30.860
and the older brother 
to the princess of the Ring of Wind

00:30.860 --> 00:33.340
that just ran away, Nefritis Romca.

00:33.720 --> 00:34.680
So,

00:35.080 --> 00:39.100
you're the famous new Ring King?

00:43.430 --> 00:44.520
Wha?!

00:45.140 --> 00:47.150
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:47.530 --> 00:50.300
Let go! Let go of me!

00:50.710 --> 00:54.240
We'll be taking him into custody for a while.

00:54.600 --> 00:58.910
Of course, the rest of you will be 
treated as state guests.

00:59.570 --> 01:01.050
Satou...

01:03.370 --> 01:04.840
Umm...

01:04.840 --> 01:08.080
have I done something wrong?

01:08.080 --> 01:11.320
My little sister Nefritis is...

01:11.320 --> 01:13.800
very, very delicate.

01:13.800 --> 01:19.140
Yeah, kind of timid, kind of immature—

01:19.140 --> 01:22.600
Don't judge her by your standards, human!

01:22.810 --> 01:26.100
Listen. Nefritis is an angel!

01:26.100 --> 01:28.090
She's pure and kind...

01:28.090 --> 01:30.830
and while she may be timid,

01:30.830 --> 01:33.940
she loves me, her older brother...

01:34.800 --> 01:37.570
She's a very, very good girl!

01:38.210 --> 01:39.570
However...

01:39.570 --> 01:41.790
she's rarely ever left the palace,

01:41.790 --> 01:45.070
let alone our nation, for certain reasons.

01:45.070 --> 01:47.910
That's why she's unaccustomed to outsiders.

01:48.370 --> 01:50.680
She's only 54, too,

01:50.680 --> 01:53.050
so it's way too early for her to get married.

01:53.050 --> 01:54.800
<i>Fifty-four?!</i>

01:55.130 --> 02:00.760
I should be fondly watching over 
her growth as her older brother...

02:00.760 --> 02:05.200
so all I need you to do is wait here patiently.

02:05.200 --> 02:07.640
Oh, it'll only be for a mere 80 years.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.730
<i>Eigh—?!</i>

02:08.730 --> 02:12.540
That'll be enough time for Nef to mature.

02:12.540 --> 02:13.190
Hey!

02:13.190 --> 02:16.620
You might be fine with that, 
but I'll die of old age!

02:21.850 --> 02:23.360
Are you sure about this?

02:23.360 --> 02:24.300
Won't doing this just...

02:24.300 --> 02:25.370
I don't care.

02:27.240 --> 02:30.000
I don't care about this so-called Abyss King.

02:30.000 --> 02:33.710
Our nation will be safe as long as 
we have our tempest wall.

02:33.710 --> 02:37.840
We have to protect the Ring of Wind
responsible for that power.

02:37.840 --> 02:41.740
That's what's most important.

04:14.120 --> 04:16.230
It's been three days...

04:16.570 --> 04:20.330
Is he seriously planning 
to hold me here forever?

04:20.330 --> 04:21.640
Ring King.

04:25.240 --> 04:27.050
Who are y—?!

04:27.660 --> 04:29.910
Don't be so loud.

04:31.870 --> 04:36.170
What do you hope to gain 
by gathering the five rings?

04:36.170 --> 04:37.840
World peace?

04:37.840 --> 04:40.010
Absolute power?

04:40.010 --> 04:43.090
Maybe beautiful princesses?

04:47.240 --> 04:49.260
I don't know what your deal is,

04:49.760 --> 04:52.190
but what I want is Hime's happiness.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.730
To live a happy married life with Hime!

04:59.010 --> 05:00.820
You are a strange one.

05:00.820 --> 05:06.050
You'll use the enormous power of 
the Ring King for just one woman, huh?

05:06.050 --> 05:07.280
I like you.

05:16.660 --> 05:18.490
You should follow me.

05:20.030 --> 05:22.460
Why are you helping me?

05:22.920 --> 05:26.300
I'm the one responsible for 
watching over this country's future.

05:26.700 --> 05:31.270
Only you, the Ring King, 
are capable of opposing the Abyss King.

05:31.270 --> 05:35.100
Prince Jade knows that, 
and yet he still imprisoned you.

05:35.440 --> 05:38.750
All because of that tempest wall.

05:38.750 --> 05:39.900
That...

05:39.900 --> 05:42.320
is a cage entrapping the elves.

05:57.140 --> 05:58.870
Now, we're here.

05:59.240 --> 06:01.340
This is the Wind Temple,

06:01.340 --> 06:03.340
the location of the Wind Ring.

06:10.220 --> 06:11.690
The ring?!

06:11.690 --> 06:12.630
Yes.

06:13.040 --> 06:17.100
That is one of the rings of power, 
the Wind Regalia.

06:17.730 --> 06:20.900
The ring that Nefritis should have inherited.

06:21.280 --> 06:23.360
What is the ring doing here?

06:23.360 --> 06:25.360
Shouldn't the princess have it?!

06:27.950 --> 06:28.920
Hide!

06:32.450 --> 06:34.730
That furball is moving?!

06:34.730 --> 06:36.790
No, that's the...

06:49.030 --> 06:51.770
Father, Mother...

06:51.770 --> 06:54.680
The Ring King has come from the outside world.

06:55.090 --> 06:56.600
He's here...

06:56.600 --> 06:59.440
to steal both the ring and me.

06:59.440 --> 07:02.560
But I will never go outside.

07:03.220 --> 07:05.500
I'll honor your command, Mother.

07:06.240 --> 07:10.330
Please continue to protect our nation's peace.

07:13.920 --> 07:17.080
She's praying to statues of her parents?

07:17.080 --> 07:18.410
Statues?

07:18.410 --> 07:19.760
You're wrong.

07:19.760 --> 07:23.240
Though their hearts have stopped 
and their bodies are petrified,

07:23.240 --> 07:25.400
they continue using the power of the ring

07:25.400 --> 07:28.390
to create that wall of wind 
as our pitiful protectors.

07:29.120 --> 07:32.430
They're the real elf king and his queen.

07:32.430 --> 07:33.430
Huh?!

07:33.760 --> 07:35.260
Is someone there?!

07:35.260 --> 07:36.540
She noticed us?

07:36.970 --> 07:40.050
Cheeep, cheep cheep cheep cheep!

07:40.050 --> 07:41.440
Wh-What are you—?!

07:41.440 --> 07:43.580
Well, trying to fool her?

07:43.580 --> 07:46.680
You idiot! There are no birds in here!

07:46.680 --> 07:50.280
P-P-Playing hide-and-seek?!

07:50.280 --> 07:54.490
C-C-Come on out, you scoundrel!

07:55.800 --> 07:58.750
It's me, the Ring King, Satou.

07:59.240 --> 08:03.870
Th-Th-The Ring King?!

08:05.490 --> 08:07.180
Good grief.

08:07.180 --> 08:09.780
She's as meek as ever.

08:10.260 --> 08:12.760
Princess? Is something the matter?

08:13.050 --> 08:15.900
It'll mean trouble if people 
from the palace catch us.

08:15.900 --> 08:18.030
Bring Nefritis with you, Ring King.

08:18.030 --> 08:19.890
Huh?! Wait, to where?!

08:20.170 --> 08:21.920
Don't worry.

08:21.920 --> 08:24.380
I know everything there is 
to know about this place.

08:24.380 --> 08:27.020
You just leave it to the Elder of the elves.

08:27.020 --> 08:28.900
E-Elder?!

08:32.580 --> 08:33.820
Princess?

08:34.530 --> 08:36.370
Nefritis has disappeared?!

08:36.370 --> 08:37.210
Yes!

08:37.210 --> 08:39.480
We're certain that she entered the Wind Temple,

08:39.480 --> 08:40.990
but she hasn't been seen since.

08:40.990 --> 08:44.830
Anyone! Has no one has seen Nefritis?!

08:46.180 --> 08:47.710
It couldn't be!

08:57.320 --> 09:00.310
I've known that girl since 
the day she was born.

09:00.720 --> 09:04.040
She may be like this now, 
but she's a strong girl at heart.

09:04.310 --> 09:06.770
She'll accept a bit of forcefulness.

09:07.430 --> 09:09.150
Fulfill your duty.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.840
Obtain the ring.

09:11.230 --> 09:13.020
Well, have a good time.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.490
Huh?

09:19.970 --> 09:22.640
<i>Wait, wait, no, no, no!</i>

09:22.640 --> 09:24.590
<i>I'm just claiming the ring!</i>

09:24.590 --> 09:26.440
<i>Nothing more than that!</i>

09:33.280 --> 09:35.520
R-Ring King?!

09:35.520 --> 09:36.490
It's okay!

09:36.490 --> 09:38.710
I won't do anything, so calm down!

09:42.260 --> 09:44.810
Blegh!

09:46.150 --> 09:47.350
I knew it!

09:47.760 --> 09:51.570
There's no mistake! It's his doing!

09:54.550 --> 09:56.840
That's right, Jade.

09:58.770 --> 10:00.450
Elder!

10:00.450 --> 10:04.670
The Ring King has left 
with the Maiden of the Ring of Wind.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.620
The two of them have eloped.

10:06.620 --> 10:07.870
E-Eloped?!

10:10.290 --> 10:11.920
I-Impossible.

10:11.920 --> 10:15.090
Nef is so terrified of others!

10:15.090 --> 10:17.590
Face reality, Jade.

10:17.590 --> 10:22.050
Your little sister! Eloped! 
With the man she loves!

10:22.050 --> 10:25.720
She'll never tell you, 
"I love big brother the most!" anymore!

10:30.190 --> 10:33.020
Now cool your head a bit, Jade.

10:33.450 --> 10:36.280
It was always the princess' destiny 
to inherit the Ring of Wind

10:36.280 --> 10:38.780
and grant power to the Ring King.

10:38.780 --> 10:42.450
Your actions were never 
for the good of Nefritis.

10:42.860 --> 10:46.070
For the good of Nefritis?

10:47.360 --> 10:51.480
The ring is still in my father 
and mother's hands,

10:51.480 --> 10:54.130
and the nation is still protected by its magic.

10:54.620 --> 10:56.590
That is what's best.

10:56.880 --> 11:00.430
There's no need for Nefritis 
to inherit the ring!

11:01.010 --> 11:02.280
Elder.

11:02.280 --> 11:05.160
I'm going to have your manor searched.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.320
I'm so sorry!

11:08.320 --> 11:11.060
For making you wash my clothes, too!

11:11.060 --> 11:14.020
My clothes needed to be washed anyway.

11:14.020 --> 11:19.740
Ah, I can't believe I've soiled the 
inter-dimensional super-being, the Ring King!

11:19.740 --> 11:21.740
How could I do such a terrifying thing?!

11:26.400 --> 11:29.000
Hey, am I really that scary?

11:29.000 --> 11:30.540
Yes, incredibly so!

11:30.540 --> 11:32.370
An instant reply, huh?

11:32.760 --> 11:36.900
I grew up without ever leaving the palace.

11:37.320 --> 11:40.570
So anyone from outside is scary.

11:41.360 --> 11:44.430
And you, the Ring King, 
are from outside our nation...

11:44.430 --> 11:48.310
and from a whole world 
outside of ours, as well...

11:51.510 --> 11:54.510
I know I might have come from another world,

11:54.510 --> 11:56.840
but I'm really not anyone that special.

11:57.870 --> 12:02.280
I'm probably not that much different 
from the humans of this world.

12:04.840 --> 12:07.200
What kind of place is it?

12:07.200 --> 12:07.950
Huh?

12:07.950 --> 12:10.500
The world you come from.

12:10.990 --> 12:12.910
What's it like?

12:12.910 --> 12:16.250
What's it like? Well...

12:16.590 --> 12:19.680
It's a terrifying place, isn't it?

12:19.680 --> 12:22.590
The kind of place that has oceans 
full of orcs and goblins,

12:22.590 --> 12:25.720
where you could be attacked 
by dragons just walking down the street?

12:25.720 --> 12:27.000
No, no, no!

12:27.000 --> 12:29.600
There aren't any monsters like that!

12:29.930 --> 12:32.420
So in that sense, it's a peaceful world.

12:33.280 --> 12:34.840
And elves?

12:34.840 --> 12:36.380
Do you have elves?

12:36.380 --> 12:38.110
In your world?!

12:38.110 --> 12:39.690
E-Elves?!

12:39.690 --> 12:40.800
Yes!

12:40.800 --> 12:41.780
<i>So close!</i>

12:41.780 --> 12:45.160
No, there probably aren't any elves.

12:45.160 --> 12:47.870
There aren't...?

12:48.900 --> 12:52.500
Are you interested in my world, by chance?

12:52.930 --> 12:53.750
Huh?

12:54.570 --> 12:57.500
They called you the shut-in princess,

12:57.500 --> 12:59.460
so I thought you'd be more averse to it.

13:00.740 --> 13:01.930
Oh, sorry!

13:01.930 --> 13:03.580
That's what your older brother called you,

13:03.580 --> 13:05.260
but I guess that's rude to say, huh?

13:05.860 --> 13:07.690
It's all right.

13:07.690 --> 13:10.620
I know others call me that.

13:10.620 --> 13:15.100
Besides, even if I am interested 
in the world outside the palace,

13:15.780 --> 13:19.210
it doesn't negate the fact 
that I'm still afraid.

13:20.500 --> 13:26.330
I usually just read the books the Elder 
brings me about the outside world,

13:26.330 --> 13:32.410
and I imagine what the scenery is like, 
what it smells like, what it feels like,

13:32.410 --> 13:34.400
and I get so excited imagining those things.

13:34.400 --> 13:38.310
It's fun, and it feels like 
I could go anywhere...

13:39.700 --> 13:43.780
But the real me is stuck in my room, 
and I can't do anything.

13:44.300 --> 13:46.010
It's weird, isn't it?

13:47.940 --> 13:50.600
Can't do anything, huh?

13:51.350 --> 13:53.200
I'm pretty much the same.

13:53.200 --> 13:54.200
Huh?

13:54.200 --> 13:57.810
I didn't come here because of 
any special powers or anything.

13:58.580 --> 14:02.590
I just came here because I didn't want to be 
separated from the woman I loved.

14:02.590 --> 14:05.840
But once I took a chance and made the leap,

14:05.840 --> 14:07.670
things worked out better than I expected.

14:09.560 --> 14:11.380
Took a chance...

14:12.870 --> 14:14.650
One day!

14:14.650 --> 14:17.370
I want to try going to your world!

14:17.370 --> 14:20.170
Would you take me there with you?!

14:22.840 --> 14:26.720
Sure, I don't mind doing that, but...

14:26.720 --> 14:27.720
your front...

14:33.350 --> 14:34.510
I'm sorry!

14:34.510 --> 14:36.980
I got so absorbed in our conversation!

14:38.130 --> 14:40.060
You know, I have to wonder...

14:40.060 --> 14:42.460
if you're that interested in the outside world,

14:42.460 --> 14:45.730
then why have you never gone outside before?

14:46.800 --> 14:48.240
That's because...

14:48.240 --> 14:49.440
Nefritis!

14:49.820 --> 14:51.180
That voice is...

14:51.570 --> 14:53.030
Nefritis!

14:53.030 --> 14:55.490
I know you're in there!

14:55.490 --> 14:56.970
Come on out!

14:57.570 --> 15:01.580
I became the Ring King 
because I chased after Hime.

15:01.580 --> 15:04.960
So while it might be my duty 
to gather the rings now,

15:04.960 --> 15:07.990
I have no intention 
of forcing anyone to marry me.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.900
Hime...

15:09.900 --> 15:12.050
That's Princess Krystal, right?

15:12.400 --> 15:13.180
Yeah.

15:13.720 --> 15:16.510
It's up to you what you want to do with me.

15:17.880 --> 15:20.240
I'll try my best, too.

15:20.240 --> 15:23.720
I'm sure my older brother 
will come to understand.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.530
Get away from her, Ring King!

15:32.530 --> 15:34.120
Satou...

15:37.370 --> 15:42.460
Brother, the Ring King is not 
the kind of man you think he is!

15:42.460 --> 15:44.060
That's foolishness!

15:44.060 --> 15:46.340
You're being deceived!

15:46.340 --> 15:48.830
The ring rests in Father and Mother's hands,

15:48.830 --> 15:52.010
and our nation is being protected by it.

15:52.010 --> 15:54.430
You understand that, don't you?

15:54.430 --> 15:57.760
Even so, I have to inherit it one day!

15:59.410 --> 16:03.230
I can't be protected forever. I—

16:03.230 --> 16:04.500
Nefritis!

16:05.020 --> 16:08.560
I am not asking for your opinion.

16:08.560 --> 16:12.110
Do you intend to betray our parents' wishes?

16:15.380 --> 16:16.840
Come to me.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.330
Nefritis?!

16:29.190 --> 16:31.020
Now, Ring King.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.800
You not only escaped from prison,

16:32.800 --> 16:35.640
you also abducted Nefritis, 
our nation's treasure.

16:36.080 --> 16:38.600
You're prepared for the consequences, yes?

16:39.200 --> 16:41.020
Wait, Jade.

16:41.020 --> 16:43.350
I was responsible for all of that.

16:43.660 --> 16:44.940
Elder!

16:45.310 --> 16:49.340
I have no idea what you were thinking.

16:49.340 --> 16:52.530
However, there are limits, even for you!

16:52.530 --> 16:54.680
Like you're one to talk, Jade.

16:54.680 --> 16:58.920
The way you treated 
the Ring King is unforgivable.

16:59.960 --> 17:02.830
I'll take care of the Ring King.

17:03.150 --> 17:04.790
You won't object, right?

17:05.510 --> 17:06.790
Very well.

17:07.460 --> 17:10.420
But never show yourself before Nefritis again.

17:11.120 --> 17:12.120
Got it?

17:21.780 --> 17:23.770
I was so worried about you.

17:24.160 --> 17:26.400
They didn't hurt you anywhere, did they?

17:26.400 --> 17:27.680
I'm fine.

17:27.680 --> 17:30.380
Though three days in a cell was rough.

17:30.380 --> 17:33.490
Lucky you, getting rescued 
by a beautiful woman.

17:34.680 --> 17:38.200
You managed to get on good terms with 
the princess at some point, too, I see.

17:39.810 --> 17:41.800
Are you jealous?

17:44.980 --> 17:46.410
Is that bad?

17:46.410 --> 17:49.290
N-No, it's not a bad thing!

17:54.500 --> 17:58.180
Sorry for the late introductions, 
Maiden of the Ring of Light.

17:59.190 --> 18:03.120
I am the oldest elf in Romca, Peridot.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.770
Oh! Uhh...

18:04.770 --> 18:10.110
I am the princess of Nokanatika, 
Krystal Novaty Nokanatika.

18:11.410 --> 18:12.590
Elder,

18:12.590 --> 18:17.740
do Nefritis' father and mother have something 
to do with how she wound up like that?

18:19.690 --> 18:23.240
Ring King, Maiden of the Ring of Light,

18:23.240 --> 18:25.790
I want you two to know this story.

18:26.110 --> 18:30.440
It's about how Romca came to be 
enveloped in a wall of wind,

18:30.440 --> 18:33.640
and why Nefritis is like that now.

18:34.710 --> 18:36.010
To start off,

18:36.640 --> 18:41.810
Nefritis and Jade's mother wasn't 
the firstborn meant to inherit the rings.

18:41.810 --> 18:43.320
She had an older sister.

18:44.110 --> 18:46.270
In order to keep the ring 
from leaving the village

18:46.270 --> 18:48.460
and protect it through the generations,

18:48.460 --> 18:53.230
it became customary for the elven princesses 
to marry someone from within our village.

18:53.720 --> 18:58.090
However, the eldest princess 
fell in love with a traveler.

18:58.090 --> 18:59.950
A human one at that.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.560
The elves began to fear.

19:02.560 --> 19:07.260
"If the traveler receives one of the rings, 
he might take it out of the village."

19:07.260 --> 19:10.000
"No, that traveler approached the princess

19:10.000 --> 19:13.420
intending to steal the ring 
from the very beginning."

19:14.000 --> 19:17.040
Various rumors began to spread 
throughout the village.

19:17.040 --> 19:20.170
As more people whispered those rumors, 
the rumors grew into suspicion,

19:20.170 --> 19:22.140
and suspicion grew into conviction.

19:22.660 --> 19:25.080
The stronger the opposition 
from those around her grew,

19:25.080 --> 19:28.420
the stronger the eldest princess's 
feelings toward the traveler grew.

19:29.190 --> 19:30.230
However,

19:31.280 --> 19:35.100
the traveler suddenly stopped 
appearing before the princess.

19:35.600 --> 19:39.030
Perhaps he was driven off 
by those trying to protect the rings,

19:39.810 --> 19:41.450
or perhaps he was erased.

19:41.450 --> 19:42.830
No way...

19:42.830 --> 19:46.200
They would go that far for the ring?

19:46.200 --> 19:51.370
The rings of power are symbols of legitimate 
authority from the age of myth.

19:51.370 --> 19:56.090
Some are even used as proof 
to justify a nation's existence.

19:56.090 --> 20:00.170
They can be blinding 
to nations without any rings.

20:00.170 --> 20:03.580
The villagers at the time were relieved.

20:03.580 --> 20:08.090
However, can you imagine how they all looked

20:08.090 --> 20:10.770
to the princess who had just 
lost her lover so suddenly?

20:11.780 --> 20:15.040
The elder princess' heart 
sank into rage and despair,

20:15.040 --> 20:18.610
and she left this village 
after laying a curse on it.

20:19.170 --> 20:21.480
"May Romca be swallowed by the Abyss!

20:21.480 --> 20:24.500
May the line of ring maidens 
come to an end!" she said.

20:25.720 --> 20:29.080
That curse she spoke weighed 
heavily on us elves.

20:29.600 --> 20:31.770
Because we possess such long lifespans,

20:31.770 --> 20:35.610
the fear that her revenge could strike 
at any moment continued on forever.

20:35.610 --> 20:40.430
The more years passed, the more 
our people grew consumed by that fear.

20:40.430 --> 20:43.340
And the same held true 
for the royalty that remained.

20:43.890 --> 20:47.870
Nefritis's parents inherited the rings 
in the eldest princess's stead,

20:47.870 --> 20:50.310
but they lived in fear 
of the eldest princess's curse.

20:50.870 --> 20:53.800
So to keep evil from ever approaching Romca,

20:53.800 --> 20:55.400
she called upon the ring's power

20:55.400 --> 20:57.770
and erected a barrier of wind.

20:57.770 --> 21:01.930
All to protect this nation... and her children.

21:03.060 --> 21:05.140
Though the price she paid was great.

21:06.620 --> 21:10.060
She also made Nefritis swear her a promise.

21:10.060 --> 21:14.080
A promise to never venture 
outside the wall of wind.

21:14.430 --> 21:18.170
That is what led to this village's 
current state.

21:18.520 --> 21:22.840
Nefritis wants to honor what 
her parents sacrificed their lives for,

21:22.840 --> 21:24.730
and she's convinced she must.

21:27.250 --> 21:28.540
Nefritis...

21:29.020 --> 21:33.160
your mother won't be able 
to talk to you anymore.

21:33.760 --> 21:35.960
Elves don't die of old age,

21:35.960 --> 21:39.880
but when our hearts stop, so do our bodies.

21:39.880 --> 21:42.900
Why is your heart going to stop?

21:43.420 --> 21:45.040
Listen to me.

21:45.040 --> 21:48.110
You must never leave this country.

21:48.480 --> 21:49.820
Promise me.

21:53.480 --> 21:58.400
We'll be watching over you 
until you ------ ------.

21:59.640 --> 22:02.790
Farewell, my beloved children.

22:07.190 --> 22:08.630
Mother...
